  "notes": "Schedule 1-A Part V line 36b: line 35 when the spouse was born before January 2, 1961, has a valid SSN, and the return is married filing jointly (f1040s1a-2025 line 36b caption; line 36b exists only 'if you are married filing jointly'); otherwise 0, never blocked -- mirrors line 36a exactly, with the spouse's conditional_dependency_set additionally gated on filing jointly, per the contract ('the spouse's only on a joint return'). A married-filing-separately or unmarried return never asks for the spouse's SSN, because spouse_over_65 defaults false for an unmarried return and the joint-return conjunct is false otherwise."
